Value Required INTERFACE (\d+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^/(?:c|cfg)/port ${INTERFACE}/name "${DESCRIPTION}"\s*$$ -> Record
  ^/(?:c|cfg)/port ${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Port

Port
  ^\s+name "${DESCRIPTION}"\s*$$
  ^\s+name ${DESCRIPTION}$$
  ^/.* -> Continue.Record
  ^/(?:c|cfg)/port ${INTERFACE}/name "${DESCRIPTION}"\s*$$ -> Record Start
  ^/(?:c|cfg)/port ${INTERFACE}\s*$$
